    "title": {
      "en": "House Sparrow or Chaffinch?"
    },
    "text": {
      "en": "Both are brownish, with a thick bill. The female Chaffinch has a plain grey-brown head and a lot of white in the wing: a white shoulder patch and wing bar. The female House Sparrow has a streaky back, a pale stripe behind the eye, and only a narrow pale line on the wing."
    }
